    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:bRaycastSuspendedByClose
    src   "Close takes the ring out of the pointer's hit test for the length of its fade and Open puts it\nback: true between the two, with the ring's own raycastable setting kept here to be restored."
    text  "Close 在淡出期间把圆环移出指针的命中测试，Open 再把它放回去：两者之间为 true，\n圆环自身的可射线检测设置会保存在此以便恢复。"
