DreamRingMenu:DeadZoneRadius {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:DeadZoneRadius
    src   "The radius inside which the POINTER picks nothing, in ring units. Zero (the default) means the\nstyle's InnerRadius, which is the hub's edge and the answer nine times in ten; a Slice menu\nthat wants a bigger \"let go here to cancel\" middle than its hub states one here.\n\nA stick has its own knob below, and deliberately so: the two are different quantities, and one\nnumber serving both would have compared a magnitude of 1 against a radius of 80."
    text  "在此半径内指针不选中任何内容，单位为环单位。零（默认值）表示\n样式的 InnerRadius，即枢纽的边缘，十次中有九次就是答案；如果 Slice 菜单\n想要比其枢纽更大的“在此松开以取消”中间区域，可在此处指定。\n\n摇杆在下方有自己的开关，这是有意为之：两者是不同的量，\n若让一个数值兼顾两者，就会拿大小为 1 的量与半径 80 相比较。"
    state machine
}

