DreamRingMenu:HighlightByDirection {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:HighlightByDirection
    src   "Highlight whichever item owns this direction -- the gamepad route.\n\nThe vector is in the ring's own frame: +X right, +Y up, exactly what a right-stick axis pair\nreads. Its LENGTH is honoured against StickDeadZone -- a magnitude, not a radius -- so a stick\nbarely off centre highlights nothing. Set StickDeadZone to zero to take any direction at all."
    text  "高亮拥有此方向的项——游戏手柄路径。\n\n该向量位于环自身的坐标系中：+X 向右，+Y 向上，正是右摇杆轴对\n读取的内容。其长度会与 StickDeadZone 比较——是大小而非半径——因此几乎离开\n中心的摇杆不会高亮任何内容。将 StickDeadZone 设为零即可接受任意方向。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:HighlightedIndex {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:HighlightedIndex
    src   "Where the pointer is. Not a UPROPERTY the way SelectedIndex is: it is nobody's to author."
