    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:HitArea {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:HitArea
    src   "See EDreamRingHitArea.\n\nBlueprintSetter, like the four knobs below it: each is read only by the style push or the hit\ntest it configures, so a runtime write straight onto the variable moved the number and left\nthe wheel behaving exactly as it did -- the SynchronizeProperties tax UDreamUIControl\ndocuments, paid here by the setter instead of by whoever forgets."
    text  "参见 EDreamRingHitArea。\n\n与下面四个旋钮一样，它是蓝图设值函数 BlueprintSetter：每一处都只由样式推送或\ntest 它所配置的命中测试读取，因此直接在运行时写入变量只会改动数值，\n而轮的行为完全不变——这就是 UDreamUIControl 所记录的 SynchronizeProperties 代价，\n此处由 setter 承担，而不是由忘记的人承担。"
    state machine
}

