DreamRingMenu:OnItemActivated {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:OnItemActivated
    src   "An item was CHOSEN -- clicked, or confirmed through ActivateHighlighted. Fires every time,\nincluding when the choice is the item already selected, because a menu entry is a command and\n\"do it again\" has to be sayable. The tag rides along so a handler never switches on an index."
    text  "某个项被选中——通过点击，或通过 ActivateHighlighted 确认。每次都会触发，\n包括所选就是当前已选中项时，因为菜单项是一条命令，\n“再来一次”必须能够表达。标签会随事件一起传递，因此处理程序永远不必根据索引做分支判断。"
    state machine
}

