DreamRingMenu:OnValueChangedBP {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:OnValueChangedBP
    src   "The `<->` convention: two-way bindings synthesize their reverse route against this exact name,\nso a value control carries it alongside its spoken events. Fires with OnSelectionChanged."
    text  "`<->` 约定：双向绑定会针对这个确切名称合成其反向路径，\n因此值控件会将它和其显式事件一起携带。与 OnSelectionChanged 一起触发。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:OnWedgeGenerated {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:OnWedgeGenerated
    src   "One per wedge, every time it is BOUND to an item. The hook for a consumer whose wedges are\nricher than an icon over a label but who would rather not author a whole class: everything\nunder the wedge is reachable from here by display name, and anything added under\nWedgeTemplateNode before the first rebuild rides into every copy."
    text  "每个扇区每次绑定到项时各触发一次。为这样的使用方提供的钩子：其扇区\n比“图标加标签”更丰富，但又不愿编写整个类：从\n这里可按显示名称访问扇区下的所有内容，并且在首次重建前添加到\nWedgeTemplateNode 下的任何内容都会带入每个副本。"
    state machine
}

