DreamRingMenu:SetHitArea {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:SetHitArea
    src   "The five setters below each write the field and then make the push that field is read by --\nthe whole of what a BlueprintSetter buys on this family. The hit-shape trio (HitArea, the\nslice's reach, the dead zone) is consulted by the raycast override at the moment a pointer\narrives rather than baked into anything drawn, so those three need no restyle at all; the two\nthat decide what a wedge SHOWS do."
    text  "下面的五个设置器各自写入字段，然后执行读取该字段所需的推送——\n这就是蓝图设值函数 BlueprintSetter 在这一系列上带来的全部作用。命中形状三件套（HitArea、\n扇区的范围、死区）在指针到达时由射线检测重写查询，\n而不是烘焙到任何绘制内容中，因此那三个完全不需要重新设置样式；而决定\n扇区显示内容的两个则需要。"
    state machine
}

