DreamRingMenu:SetWedgeTemplateClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:SetWedgeTemplateClass
    src   "The authored wedge content. Instanced into each wedge at build, so a new class means a rebuild."
    text  "制作的扇区内容。构建时实例化到每个扇区中，因此换用新类意味着重建。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:SliceHitRadiusScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:SliceHitRadiusScale
    src   "How far a Slice reaches, as a multiple of the ring's outer radius. Ignored by Ring.\n\nTwo is one more ring's worth of slack -- comfortably past what is drawn, which is the whole\npoint of Slice, and still a bounded shape that a neighbour can be clicked outside of. It\nscales with the ring rather than being a pixel count, so a bigger wheel reaches further by\nitself.\n\nZERO IS NO LIMIT, and it is the weapon-wheel setting: the slice claims its direction to the\nedge of the screen and beyond. Correct for a menu that owns the screen (put it over a blocker,\nthe way a modal does) and wrong for anything sharing a panel -- an unbounded wedge wins the\nraycast against every widget earlier in the hierarchy, which is most of them."
    text  "Slice 的延伸距离，以环外半径的倍数表示。Ring 会忽略此项。\n\n二相当于多出一个环的余量——稳稳超出绘制范围，而这正是 Slice\n的意义所在，同时仍是有限形状，邻居可以在其外部被点击。它\n随环缩放而不是按像素计数，因此更大的轮盘自身\n就能延伸得更远。\n\n零表示没有限制，也就是武器轮盘的设置：Slice 会将其方向延伸到\n屏幕边缘乃至更远。对于独占屏幕的菜单这是正确的（像模态那样放在阻挡器\n上方），对于任何与面板共享空间的情况则是错误的——无界扇区会在\n射线检测中胜过层级中更早的每个控件，而那是大多数控件。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:StepHighlight {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:StepHighlight
    src   "Step the highlight round the ring, skipping disabled items. Wraps on a full wheel and stops at\nthe ends of a partial one -- a half-ring has a first and a last item, and pretending otherwise\nis how a keyboard user ends up somewhere off screen."
    text  "沿环步进高亮，跳过已禁用项。完整轮盘上循环，部分轮盘上\n在两端停止——半环有第一项和最后一项，假装不是这样，\n键盘用户就会跑到屏幕之外的某处。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:StickDeadZone {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:StickDeadZone
    src   "How far a stick must be pushed before HighlightByDirection picks anything, as the vector's\nMAGNITUDE -- an axis pair is already normalized, so this is 0 to 1 and has nothing to do with\nthe ring's radii. What stops a resting stick's jitter from choosing an item every frame."
    text  "摇杆必须推动多远，HighlightByDirection 才会选中内容，以向量的\n模（MAGNITUDE）表示——轴对已经归一化，因此范围是 0 到 1，与\n环的半径无关。它能防止静止摇杆的抖动每帧都选中一个项。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet\nactually exists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect -- which is why it\nstays editable instead of being gated on the enum."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 如此指定且项目中确实存在样式表时，项目样式表\n优先；项目中不存在样式表时，此属性就是实际生效的外观——这也是它\n保持可编辑、而不是被枚举加以门控的原因。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:WedgeNodes {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:WedgeNodes
    src   "The wedge widgets, parallel to Items."
    text  "扇区控件，与 Items 一一对应。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:WedgeRootNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:WedgeRootNode
    src   "What the wedges are children of -- the template among them."
    text  "扇区的父级——模板也在其中。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:WedgeTemplateClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:WedgeTemplateClass
    src   "A wedge's CONTENT, authored elsewhere: one instance of this class is created inside every\nwedge widget, filling it, and the built-in label steps aside. The wedge's shape, its hit\nsector, its highlight and its click stay the control's, so a template only has to draw an item.\n\nCreated once per POOL wedge rather than per bind, which is what makes it survive a rebuild of\nthe item list; OnWedgeGenerated fires on every bind, and that is where a consumer updates it.\n\nNull (the default) is the built-in label. Instancing a user widget needs a world, so with none\nthis quietly stays the built-in wedge rather than producing half a ring. Exactly the bargain\nUDreamListViewBase::RowTemplateClass makes, in the same words."
    text  "扇区的内容（CONTENT），在别处制作：在每个\n扇区控件内创建一个该类实例并填充它，内置标签随之让位。扇区的形状、命中\n区域、高亮和点击仍归控件所有，因此模板只需绘制一个项。\n\n按池中的每个扇区创建一次，而不是每次绑定创建，这正是它能在项列表\n重建后存活的原因；OnWedgeGenerated 在每次绑定时触发，使用方就在那里更新它。\n\n空（默认值）表示使用内置标签。实例化用户控件需要世界，因此没有\n世界时会安静地保留内置扇区，而不会产生半个环。与\nUDreamListViewBase::RowTemplateClass 做出的正是同样的取舍，用的也是同样的话。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenu:WedgeTemplateNode {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenu:WedgeTemplateNode
    src   "The thing wedges are copied from -- authored once, inactive, never drawn itself. Public\nbecause it is half of the \"hand it a template\" story."
    text  "扇区复制自的对象——只制作一次，处于非活动状态，自身从不绘制。之所以\n公开，是因为它是“交给它一个模板”这一用法的另一半。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem
    src   "One entry on the wheel.\n\nA struct rather than an FText the way the dropdown's options are, because a ring menu's item is\nnot a line of text -- it is a command. The tag is what a handler switches on; an index is a\nterrible name for \"Reload\", and it stops being the right one the moment somebody inserts an item."
    text  "轮盘上的一个条目。\n\n采用结构体而不是像下拉菜单选项那样使用FText，是因为环形菜单的条目\n不是一行文本——而是一条命令。处理程序根据标签进行分支；用索引作为\n“Reload”的名称很糟糕，一旦有人插入条目，它就不再是正确的名称。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem:bEnabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem:bEnabled
    src   "Off wears the style's disabled colour, stops answering the pointer, and cannot be highlighted."
    text  "关闭时采用样式的禁用颜色，不再响应指针，并且无法高亮。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem:bOverrideColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem:bOverrideColor
    src   "This one wedge's RESTING colour, replacing the style's WedgeNormal. Hover, press and the\nselected colour stay the style's, so a red \"delete\" still highlights like everything else."
    text  "此扇区的静止颜色，替代样式的WedgeNormal。悬停、按下和\n选中颜色仍使用样式的颜色，因此红色的“delete”仍会像其他项一样高亮。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem:Icon {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem:Icon
    src   "The picture over the label. Empty is a label-only item; the label steps aside when the brush\nis the only thing set, so an icon-only wheel is a wheel with no labels typed into it."
    text  "标签上方的图片。为空时是仅含标签的条目；当仅设置画刷时，标签会让位，\n因此仅图标轮盘就是没有输入任何标签的轮盘。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem:Label {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem:Label
    src   "What the wedge says, and what the hub shows while this item is highlighted."
    text  "扇区显示的内容，以及此条目高亮时中心显示的内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem:Payload {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem:Payload
    src   "Whatever the consumer needs back when this item is chosen. The control never reads it."
    text  "当此项被选中时，消费者需要返回的数据。控件不会读取此数据。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem:Tag {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem:Tag
    src   "What this item MEANS, carried into OnItemActivated so a handler never switches on an index."
    text  "当此项被选中时，消费者需要返回的数据。控件不会读取此数据。"
    state machine
}

DreamRingMenuItem:Weight {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#DreamRingMenuItem:Weight
    src   "How wide this item's slice is, relative to the others. Equal weights is the even wheel; a\nweight of 2 takes twice the angle of a weight of 1, which is how a \"cancel\" quadrant sits\nbeside six small ones. Zero-or-less is treated as one, and a set that adds to nothing spreads\nevenly -- neither is worth an error message when the honest answer is an even ring."
    text  "此条目扇区的宽度相对于其他条目的比例。权重相等即为均匀轮盘；权重2\n占据的角度是权重1的两倍，这样“cancel”象限就能与六个小象限并排。\n小于等于零按一处理，总和为零的集合会均匀分布——当合理的答案就是均匀环时，\n这两种情况都不值得报错。"
    state machine
}

EDreamRingHitArea {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#EDreamRingHitArea
    src   "What a wedge claims of the pointer."
    text  "指针所指向的区域。"
    state machine
}

EDreamRingHitArea.Ring {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#EDreamRingHitArea:Ring
    src   "Exactly the annulus that is drawn. The hub and everything past the outer edge are dead."
    text  "绘制的环形区域。中心区域和超出外边缘的部分无效。"
    state machine
}

EDreamRingHitArea.Slice {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#EDreamRingHitArea:Slice
    src   "The slice, reaching PAST the drawn ring -- the weapon-wheel feel, where a flick of the mouse\nshort of the ring still picks the item in that direction. How far past is SliceHitRadiusScale,\nand that knob is not decoration: nothing culls a widget by its bounds before the trace, so an\nunbounded slice really does claim its whole direction across the screen, and the raycast sort\nhands a wedge every hit against anything earlier in the hierarchy. A menu that owns the screen\nwants exactly that; a menu sharing a panel with other controls makes them unclickable."
    text  "扇区会延伸到绘制环之外——这是武器轮盘的手感：鼠标未触及环的轻甩\n仍会选中该方向上的条目。延伸多远由SliceHitRadiusScale决定，\n而这个参数并非装饰：在射线检测之前，没有任何东西会按边界剔除控件，因此\n无界扇区确实会占据屏幕上其整个方向，而射线检测排序\n会把对层级中更早任何对象的每次命中都交给扇区。独占屏幕的菜单\n正需要这一点；与其他控件共享面板的菜单则会使它们无法点击。"
    state machine
}

EDreamRingLabelFacing {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#EDreamRingLabelFacing
    src   "How an item's icon and label are turned."
    text  "图标和标签的旋转方式。"
    state machine
}

EDreamRingLabelFacing.Radial {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#EDreamRingLabelFacing:Radial
    src   "Turned a further quarter, so text reads outward along the radius."
    text  "旋转四分之一，文本沿半径方向显示。"
    state machine
}

EDreamRingLabelFacing.Tangential {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#EDreamRingLabelFacing:Tangential
    src   "Turned with the ring, so text runs along the tangent and its top faces outward."
    text  "与环一起旋转，文本沿切线方向显示，顶部朝外。"
    state machine
}

EDreamRingLabelFacing.Upright {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamRingMenu.h#EDreamRingLabelFacing:Upright
    src   "Never turned. The readable default, and the only one that stays readable at the bottom."
    text  "未旋转。默认的可读方向，也是唯一始终保持可读的方向。"
    state machine
}

